{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">NORMALIZE function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310129","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/NORMALIZE-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/NORMALIZE-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"NORMALIZE-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">NORMALIZE function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the normalized form of a character\nstring based on the specified Unicode normalization form. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"NORMALIZE-function__syntax_GC19W32697593\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d378337e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"NORMALIZE-function__idGDM2O52673033\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>NORMALIZE ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">string</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">normalization-form</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">string</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The source string to normalize. The value may be of type CHARACTER\nor LONGCHAR.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n      <p class=\"p\">If the string is a CHARACTER\nvalue, <code class=\"ph codeph\">-cpinternal</code> must be set to UTF-8. If the\nstring is a LONGCHAR value, its code page can be any form of Unicode\n(for example, UTF-8, UTF-16, or UTF-32). This function returns a\nvalue of the same data type as the source string.</p>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">normalization-form</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A character expression that evaluates to one of the following Unicode\nnormalization forms: <ul class=\"ul\"><li class=\"li\"><strong class=\"ph b\">NFD</strong> — Canonical Decomposition</li><li class=\"li\"><strong class=\"ph b\">NFC</strong> — Canonical Decomposition, followed by Canonical Composition</li><li class=\"li\"><strong class=\"ph b\">NFKD</strong> — Compatibility Decomposition</li><li class=\"li\"><strong class=\"ph b\">NFKC</strong> — Compatibility Decomposition, followed by Canonical\nComposition</li><li class=\"li\"><strong class=\"ph b\">NONE</strong> — Returns the source string unchanged</li></ul></dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"NEXT-VALUE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/NEXT-VALUE-function.html\">NEXT-VALUE function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"NOT-operator-bitwise.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/NOT-operator-bitwise.html\">NOT operator (bitwise)</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310129","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"NORMALIZE function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/NORMALIZE-function.html","type":"Manual"}